{"version":1,"content":"<p>許志安一連3場「許志安 Andy Hui〈On Stage〉Live in Concert 2026」昨晚（10日）圓滿落幕。</p><p>太太鄭秀文（Sammi）與家人全體現身後台合照全家福，全力到場支持。</p><p>Sammi今天（11日）於社交平台發文抒發感受，坦言直至完場「終能放鬆了」，並表達內心無盡感觸與感激。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T09:18:34.897090+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T08:38:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T10:37:38.718741+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"b0a122d9e10f8992cf64c0e1947a38bdd14358b39f70e7d01277839e2f146aa4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}